              <path d="M18 105 A42 42 0 0 1 102 105" fill="none" stroke="#F5C451" stroke-width="8" />
              <path d="M26 105 A34 34 0 0 1 94 105" fill="none" stroke="#3FA36C" stroke-width="8" />
              <rect x="0" y="120" width="120" height="40" fill="#23476A" />
              <path d="M30 0 V160 M60 0 V160 M90 0 V160 M0 32 H120 M0 64 H120 M0 96 H120 M0 128 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="2.5" />
            </svg>
            <h4>El Arco de la Promesa</h4>
            <span class="vf-mural-meta">4 × 5 · 20 cuadros</span>
            <p class="vf-mural-theme">Génesis 9: mi arco he puesto en las nubes como pacto.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="vf-mural-card">
            <svg class="vf-mural-thumb" viewBox="0 0 120 160" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="120" height="160" fill="#101534" />
              <polygon points="60,12 67,38 92,42 67,48 60,82 53,48 28,42 53,38" fill="#F5C451" />
              <path d="M0 116 Q60 98 120 116 V160 H0 Z" fill="#2A2444" />
              <rect x="44" y="114" width="32" height="24" fill="#6F4C2E" />
              <path d="M30 0 V160 M60 0 V160 M90 0 V160 M0 40 H120 M0 80 H120 M0 120 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="2.5" />
            </svg>
            <h4>Estrella de Belén</h4>
            <span class="vf-mural-meta">4 × 4 · 16 cuadros</span>
            <p class="vf-mural-theme">Mateo 2: al ver la estrella, se llenaron de alegría.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="vf-mural-card">
            <svg class="vf-mural-thumb" viewBox="0 0 120 160" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="120" height="160" fill="#1E284D" />
              <path d="M0 44 H42 L34 160 H0 Z" fill="#2567A8" />
              <path d="M120 44 H78 L86 160 H120 Z" fill="#2567A8" />
              <path d="M42 44 H78 L86 160 H34 Z" fill="#D4A66A" />
              <rect x="54" y="8" width="12" height="44" fill="#F08A38" />
              <path d="M30 0 V160 M60 0 V160 M90 0 V160 M0 32 H120 M0 64 H120 M0 96 H120 M0 128 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="2.5" />
            </svg>
            <h4>Camino en el Mar</h4>
            <span class="vf-mural-meta">4 × 5 · 20 cuadros</span>
            <p class="vf-mural-theme">Éxodo 14: las aguas fueron como un muro a ambos lados.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="vf-mural-card">
            <svg class="vf-mural-thumb" viewBox="0 0 120 160" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="120" height="160" fill="#D97C4B" />
              <circle cx="60" cy="48" r="24" fill="#FFE680" />
              <path d="M0 108 Q60 92 120 108 V160 H0 Z" fill="#3D7856" />
              <circle cx="60" cy="120" r="22" fill="#FFF7DF" />
              <circle cx="46" cy="122" r="14" fill="#2B2420" />
              <path d="M24 0 V160 M48 0 V160 M72 0 V160 M96 0 V160 M0 32 H120 M0 64 H120 M0 96 H120 M0 128 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="2.2" />
            </svg>
            <h4>El Jardín del Alba</h4>
            <span class="vf-mural-meta">5 × 5 · 25 cuadros</span>
            <p class="vf-mural-theme">Lucas 24: ¿por qué buscan entre los muertos al que vive?</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="vf-murals-grid vf-hidden" id="grid-special">
          <article class="vf-mural-card">
            <svg class="vf-mural-thumb" viewBox="0 0 120 160" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="120" height="160" fill="#46205E" />
              <polygon points="24,96 32,54 48,74 60,46 72,74 88,54 96,96" fill="#F5C451" />
              <rect x="24" y="96" width="72" height="14" fill="#D9A21B" />
              <path d="M40 0 V160 M80 0 V160 M0 53 H120 M0 106 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="3" />
            </svg>
            <h4>Corona de Gracia</h4>
            <span class="vf-mural-meta">3 × 3 · 9 cuadros · 45 pts</span>
            <p class="vf-mural-theme">La gracia que corona la vida.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="vf-mural-card">
            <svg class="vf-mural-thumb" viewBox="0 0 120 160" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="120" height="160" fill="#181228" />
              <circle cx="60" cy="78" r="34" fill="#B83B28" />
              <polygon points="60,30 78,76 60,104 42,76" fill="#F5C451" />
              <rect x="0" y="122" width="120" height="38" fill="#6F462B" />
              <path d="M40 0 V160 M80 0 V160 M0 40 H120 M0 80 H120 M0 120 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="3" />
            </svg>
            <h4>La Zarza Ardiente</h4>
            <span class="vf-mural-meta">3 × 4 · 12 cuadros · 65 pts</span>
            <p class="vf-mural-theme">Éxodo 3: el fuego ardía y la zarza no se consumía.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="vf-mural-card">
            <svg class="vf-mural-thumb" viewBox="0 0 120 160" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="120" height="160" fill="#2B3E2A" />
              <path d="M60 154 C54 114 70 86 58 40" fill="none" stroke="#6E4427" stroke-width="10" />
              <circle cx="42" cy="56" r="14" fill="#4CA35C" />
              <circle cx="78" cy="50" r="15" fill="#4CA36C" />
              <circle cx="44" cy="94" r="9" fill="#7C347D" />
              <circle cx="54" cy="96" r="9" fill="#9A459C" />
              <path d="M40 0 V160 M80 0 V160 M0 40 H120 M0 80 H120 M0 120 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="3" />
            </svg>
            <h4>La Vid Verdadera</h4>
            <span class="vf-mural-meta">3 × 4 · 12 cuadros · 75 pts</span>
            <p class="vf-mural-theme">Juan 15: yo soy la vid, ustedes son las ramas.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="vf-mural-card">
            <svg class="vf-mural-thumb" viewBox="0 0 120 160" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="120" height="160" fill="#121426" />
