              <line x1="60" y1="74" x2="60" y2="148" stroke="#2F6E42" stroke-width="5" />
              <circle cx="60" cy="64" r="18" fill="#FFF9ED" />
              <circle cx="60" cy="64" r="6" fill="#F5C451" />
              <path d="M30 0 V160 M60 0 V160 M90 0 V160 M0 40 H120 M0 80 H120 M0 120 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="2.5" />
            </svg>
            <h4>Lirios del Campo</h4>
            <span class="vf-mural-meta">4 × 4 · 16 cuadros · 95 pts</span>
            <p class="vf-mural-theme">Mateo 6: miren cómo crecen los lirios del campo.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="vf-mural-card">
            <svg class="vf-mural-thumb" viewBox="0 0 120 160" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="120" height="160" fill="#1C2754" />
              <rect x="22" y="72" width="76" height="62" fill="#D4A446" />
              <rect x="44" y="38" width="32" height="96" fill="#F5C451" />
              <rect x="0" y="134" width="120" height="26" fill="#2E9E73" />
              <path d="M30 0 V160 M60 0 V160 M90 0 V160 M0 40 H120 M0 80 H120 M0 120 H120" stroke="#090910" stroke-width="2.5" />
